{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114435","id":3135829627,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc666PZ7","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114435","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114435.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114435.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114435","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114435/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114435/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114435/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1cc1f4ff888255b10d1f96db22103b654de4f7e3","number":114435,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add initial minimum/maximum viewport size to the project settings","user":{"login":"Cautami","id":219921783,"node_id":"U_kgDODRu9dw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/219921783?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami","html_url":"https://github.com/Cautami","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR supersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/87168 and closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/7586.\r\n\r\nAdds Minimum/Maximum Window Size to the project settings. \r\nSetting these values will cause the window that is created with the main loop (the initial game window) to the specified minimum/maximum size.\r\n\r\nTo say I'm a fan of how this looks in the project settings would be a lie. \r\n<img width=\"974\" height=\"270\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a113c599-5086-41c9-b5ea-835239d995f6\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nI do not particularly care for 4 separate options (these should all be Vector2i's), however seeing as the precedent of both of the size options (Viewport Height/Width, Window Height/Width Override) being separate integer settings, it would be peculiar for these options to be Vector2i's (despite my annoyance). \r\n\r\nThis PR is intentionally rather light on the logic side, it's not doing anything too complicated, just providing a way to overwrite variables that were already there. The only new logic is the set_max_size which was not previously there, but from my testing seems to do okay? \r\n\r\nI was considering making the default the recommended max of an 8K resolution, but given the prior default was the 16 bit integer limit + 1(?) I was unsure if setting it to anything else would cause incompatibilities, I hope you future kids with your 16k monitors are happy. \r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16